Initialize_Concrete_Test
├── when called on the implementation
│   └── it should revert
├── given the proxy is already initialized
│   └── it should revert
└── given the proxy is not initialized
    ├── when an address is zero
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when every address is set
        ├── when the token has fewer than 6 or more than 9 decimals
        │   └── it should revert
        └── when the token has 6 to 9 decimals
            ├── when the pool floor is below 500 whole tokens
            │   └── it should revert
            └── when the pool floor is at least 500 whole tokens
                ├── when the refund delay is between 1 second and 1 hour
                │   └── it should revert
                └── when the refund delay is 0 or at least 1 hour
                    ├── when the breaker window is outside 60 to 86400 seconds
                    │   └── it should revert
                    └── when the breaker window is 60 to 86400 seconds
                        ├── it should grant each role to exactly its holders
                        ├── it should make the default admin every role's admin
                        ├── it should store every setting
                        ├── it should set the EIP-712 domain
                        └── it should emit the setup events in order
